VitalLite
=========

This directory is a JavaScript AudioWorklet port of the nine effect-rack
modules from Vital by Matt Tytel:

  https://github.com/mtytel/vital

Original C++ © 2013-2019 Matt Tytel, licensed under GNU GPL v3.
The port (this directory) is a derivative work and is therefore also
GPL-3.0-or-later. See ./LICENSE.

The C++ tree used as a reference lives at third_party/vital/ (gitignored,
not shipped in the web bundle). Vital factory presets are under a separate
licence and are not included here.

The name "VitalLite" is a description of the port, not a claim on the
Vital / Vital Audio trademarks.
